    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not about \"finding a path\" or anything. it's deeper than that. it's like i'm seeing things for what they actually are, and everyone else is just blind. there's this weight to everything, like reality is just paper thin. it feels like i've already crossed over and i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up. it almost feels more peaceful to just... stop trying to participate in it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
